00:08:34,182 --> 00:08:35,692
pension became law,

300
00:08:35,752 --> 00:08:37,052
paid for by workers,

301
00:08:37,092 --> 00:08:38,812
employers and the state.

302
00:08:39,042 --> 00:08:41,662
America followed in 1935.

303
00:08:41,852 --> 00:08:42,572
At the signing,

304
00:08:42,612 --> 00:08:43,672
President Franklin

305
00:08:43,712 --> 00:08:45,322
Roosevelt said why.

306
00:08:46,072 --> 00:08:48,932
Young people have come to wonder

307
00:08:48,972 --> 00:08:50,252
what would be their lot

308
00:08:50,292 --> 00:08:52,992
when they came to old age.

309
00:08:53,032 --> 00:08:55,232
The man with a job has wondered

310
00:08:55,272 --> 00:08:58,822
how long the job would last.

311
00:08:59,242 --> 00:09:01,432
His answer wasn't a promise.

312
00:09:01,502 --> 00:09:02,712
It was a law.

313
00:09:02,842 --> 00:09:04,552
With amounts, with dates,

314
00:09:04,592 --> 00:09:05,582
and with money set

315
00:09:05,622 --> 00:09:06,892
aside years before

316
00:09:06,932 --> 00:09:08,492
the first monthly check.

317
00:09:08,822 --> 00:09:11,242
Then one winter, a retired woman

318
00:09:11,282 --> 00:09:13,502
in Vermont opened her mailbox.

319
00:09:13,812 --> 00:09:15,302
Ida May Fuller.

320
00:09:15,362 --> 00:09:16,612
Check number one.

321
00:09:16,882 --> 00:09:17,832
She kept getting them

322
00:09:17,872 --> 00:09:19,402
until she was a hundred.

323
00:09:19,552 --> 00:09:21,472
Not because someone was generous.

324
00:09:21,512 --> 00:09:23,282
Because the law said so.

325
00:09:23,672 --> 00:09:25,802
Even this law needs repairs.

326
00:09:25,842 --> 00:09:27,232
Unless Congress acts,

327
00:09:27,272 --> 00:09:28,132
Social Security

328
00:09:28,172 --> 00:09:29,212
checks will shrink

329
00:09:29,252 --> 00:09:30,922
in the early 2030s.

330
00:09:31,062 --> 00:09:33,112
Shrink, not stop.

331
00:09:33,252 --> 00:09:34,502
That's the difference.

332
00:09:34,702 --> 00:09:36,402
A promise can be kept.

333
00:09:36,522 --> 00:09:38,394
A law has to be.

334
00:09:38,974 --> 00:09:40,384
If machines really do

335
00:09:40,424 --> 00:09:41,684
take over the work,

336
00:09:41,754 --> 00:09:42,904
an income from all

337
00:09:42,944 --> 00:09:44,474
that abundance only counts

338
00:09:44,514 --> 00:09:46,664
once it's built the same way.

339
00:09:46,864 --> 00:09:48,794
A right, written down,

340
00:09:48,834 --> 00:09:51,064
paid for before you need it.

341
00:09:51,294 --> 00:09:52,844
The day you stop working:

342
00:09:53,004 --> 00:09:54,724
a check in your mailbox.

343
00:09:54,884 --> 00:09:57,034
Not because a forecast came true.

344
00:09:57,144 --> 00:09:58,844
Because a law says so.

345
00:09:59,124 --> 00:10:01,144
That law doesn't exist yet.

346
00:10:01,264 --> 00:10:02,224
Writing it is up

347
00:10:02,264 --> 00:10:04,274
to voters and lawmakers.

348
00:10:05,414 --> 00:10:06,774
The five lines, then.

349
00:10:07,154 --> 00:10:09,054
One, on its way.

350
00:10:09,304 --> 00:10:10,954
One, half true.

351
00:10:11,104 --> 00:10:12,844
And three that fail.

352
00:10:13,054 --> 00:10:14,164
The three that decide

353
00:10:14,204 --> 00:10:16,384
your old age: the income,

354
00:10:16,424 --> 00:10:17,824
the timing, and who

355
00:10:17,864 --> 00:10:19,204
carries the risk.

356
00:10:19,344 --> 00:10:22,214
As advice, it fails its own test.

357
00:10:23,224 --> 00:10:25,034
Maybe one day he'll be right.

358
00:10:25,314 --> 00:10:27,254
That future would be worth having.

359
00:10:27,504 --> 00:10:28,764
But someone has to pay

360
00:10:28,804 --> 00:10:30,274
for the years in between.

361
00:10:30,454 --> 00:10:31,704
Until a law does,

362
00:10:31,744 --> 00:10:33,434
that someone is you.

363
00:10:33,674 --> 00:10:35,054
Saving was never a bet

364
00:10:35,094 --> 00:10:36,374
against the future.

365
00:10:36,424 --> 00:10:37,924
It's the bridge to it.

366
00:10:38,474 --> 00:10:39,544
This channel exists

367
00:10:39,584 --> 00:10:40,854
for one reason:

368
00:10:40,984 --> 00:10:41,864
so that the arrival

369
00:10:41,904 --> 00:10:43,224
of superintelligence goes

370
00:10:43,264 --> 00:10:44,364
well for everybody,

371
00:10:44,404 --> 00:10:46,684
and everybody makes it across.

372
00:10:46,824 --> 00:10:47,794
Want that too?

373
00:10:47,834 --> 00:10:48,934
Then subscribe.

